{'symbol': 'JNPR', 'date': '2022-12-13 21:00:00', 'title': "CHINESE INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL TAPS INTO JUNIPER NETWORKS' AI-DRIVEN SOLUTIONS TO ENHANCE DIGITAL LEARNING EXPERIENCE FOR STUDENTS", 'text': "HONG KONG--( BUSINESS WIRE )--JUNIPER NETWORKS (NYSE: JNPR), A LEADER IN SECURE, AI-DRIVEN NETWORKS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHINESE INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL (CIS), A LEADING PRIVATE INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL WITH A DYNAMIC, DUAL-LANGUAGE LEARNING COMMUNITY, HAS SELECTED JUNIPER'S WIRELESS SOLUTIONS TO BUILD A ROBUST AI-DRIVEN LEARNING NETWORK TO ENABLE RICH AND IMMERSIVE DIGITAL LEARNING EXPERIENCES FOR ITS STUDENTS AND TEACHERS."}